{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 1, "text": "布依族文化大观", "bbox_px": {"x": 712, "y": 181, "w": 289, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族文化大观", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 712, "y": 181, "w": 289, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 2, "text": "歌谣在原始阶段始终以表现劳动为主，可以说是直接为劳动服务的。它所反映的是劳动", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 286, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "歌谣在原始阶段始终以表现劳动为主，可以说是直接为劳动服务的。它所反映的是劳动", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 286, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 3, "text": "的过程，表达的是对劳动的感情，歌咏的是劳动者本身及劳动的价值。因此民歌和民间", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 350, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的过程，表达的是对劳动的感情，歌咏的是劳动者本身及劳动的价值。因此民歌和民间", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 350, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 4, "text": "故事一样，起源于原始社会。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 422, "w": 494, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "故事一样，起源于原始社会。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 422, "w": 494, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 5, "text": "明、清以来，随着民族压迫和阶级压迫的日益深重，布依族人民纷纷丧失土地，背负", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 479, "w": 1463, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "明、清以来，随着民族压迫和阶级压迫的日益深重，布依族人民纷纷丧失土地，背负", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 479, "w": 1463, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 6, "text": "着沉重的赋税，生活十分艰苦。在这种社会历史条件下，布依族人民创作了丰富的表达", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 543, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "着沉重的赋税，生活十分艰苦。在这种社会历史条件下，布依族人民创作了丰富的表达", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 543, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 7, "text": "反封建、反压迫、揭露社会黑暗的民歌，如反歌、苦歌等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 612, "w": 969, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "反封建、反压迫、揭露社会黑暗的民歌，如反歌、苦歌等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 612, "w": 969, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 8, "text": "如《苦歌》唱道：", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 680, "w": 277, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "如《苦歌》唱道：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 680, "w": 277, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 9, "text": "苦、苦、苦，三年两头苦。", "bbox_px": {"x": 410, "y": 748, "w": 414, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "苦、苦、苦，三年两头苦。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 410, "y": 748, "w": 414, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 10, "text": "百姓肚子空，官家粮生蛀。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 804, "w": 488, "h": 69}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "百姓肚子空，官家粮生蛀。①", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 804, "w": 488, "h": 69}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 11, "text": "《肥了肚肠烂心肝》唱道：", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 873, "w": 446, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《肥了肚肠烂心肝》唱道：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 873, "w": 446, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 12, "text": "鸡嘴尖来鸭嘴宽，肚子饿了空叫天。", "bbox_px": {"x": 410, "y": 941, "w": 619, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "鸡嘴尖来鸭嘴宽，肚子饿了空叫天。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 410, "y": 941, "w": 619, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 13, "text": "财主都是贪婪鬼，肥了肚肠烂心肝。②", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1006, "w": 643, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "财主都是贪婪鬼，肥了肚肠烂心肝。②", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1006, "w": 643, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 14, "text": "《吃钱吃米吃人肉》唱道：", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1070, "w": 442, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《吃钱吃米吃人肉》唱道：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1070, "w": 442, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 15, "text": "财主住的高高楼，高楼层层穷人修。", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1139, "w": 615, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "财主住的高高楼，高楼层层穷人修。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1139, "w": 615, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 16, "text": "积善堂里阎王殿，吃钱吃米吃人肉。③", "bbox_px": {"x": 410, "y": 1199, "w": 651, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "积善堂里阎王殿，吃钱吃米吃人肉。③", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 410, "y": 1199, "w": 651, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 17, "text": "布依族人民以民歌的方式，对社会的黑暗现实和不平等现象作了无情的揭露和鞭", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1263, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族人民以民歌的方式，对社会的黑暗现实和不平等现象作了无情的揭露和鞭", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1263, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 18, "text": "挞，表达了对太平社会的理想追求。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1336, "w": 619, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "挞，表达了对太平社会的理想追求。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1336, "w": 619, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 19, "text": "在残酷的封建压迫和剥削面前，布依族人民并没有甘于屈辱和统治者的压榨，相反", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1396, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在残酷的封建压迫和剥削面前，布依族人民并没有甘于屈辱和统治者的压榨，相反", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1396, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 20, "text": "却发出了强烈的反抗呼声。如《百姓就要起来反抗》歌唱道：", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1460, "w": 1049, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "却发出了强烈的反抗呼声。如《百姓就要起来反抗》歌唱道：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1460, "w": 1049, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 21, "text": "水缸里的水满了，", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1533, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "水缸里的水满了，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1533, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 22, "text": "水就要往外淌。", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1596, "w": 270, "h": 51}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "水就要往外淌。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1596, "w": 270, "h": 51}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 23, "text": "官家对百姓压榨多了，", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1662, "w": 394, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "官家对百姓压榨多了，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1662, "w": 394, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 24, "text": "百姓就要起来反抗。④", "bbox_px": {"x": 417, "y": 1722, "w": 375, "h": 59}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "百姓就要起来反抗。④", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 417, "y": 1722, "w": 375, "h": 59}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 25, "text": "这就是，哪里有压迫，哪里就有反抗。", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1786, "w": 643, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这就是，哪里有压迫，哪里就有反抗。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1786, "w": 643, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 124, "line_no": 26, "text": "《起义歌》唱道：", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1855, "w": 277, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《起义歌》唱道：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1855, "w": 277, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
